"text":"ヅカチックな風貌の為、女性のファンが多くその人気は学園内とどまらず他校にも多くファンを持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味は外見とは違い恋愛小説だったりファンシーグッズ集めだったりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼馴染の芽衣とは幼少からの付き合いで常に芽衣に付添っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26822","sourceWorkId":"12124","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"3年B組。遼たちの先輩で副生徒会長。生徒会長の芽衣とは家が隣同士の幼馴染。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"剣道部で主将でもあり全国大会の常連。外見は168と比較女性としては長身でボーイッシュ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヅカチックな風貌の為、女性のファンが多くその人気は学園内とどまらず他校に及ぶ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味は外見とは違い恋愛小説だったりファンシーグッズ集めだったりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼馴染の芽衣とは幼少からの付き合いで常に芽衣に付添っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"芽衣に対しては少々過保護気味で気の弱い芽衣を守ること、世話を焼くことを生きがいとしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「芽衣をサポートするのが私の役目だから」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"50511"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"84 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26822","sourceWorkId":"12124","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"168 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26822","sourceWorkId":"12124","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26822","sourceWorkId":"12124","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"60 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26822","sourceWorkId":"12124","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b2/b2635aae17aa7029a0668e2d136853e5f15cfd428456337f76d6cd8dd7909e74.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/aa/aacde9a51d4057f91f6b2a99d0f3f3007b82fc80f1cbcd797199d3dfd9d18264.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"平田宏美","creatorId":"vndb:s1058","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1058","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1058","name":"平田 宏美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identitySta